{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harventure</strong> is an incremental game inspired by <i>To the Core</i> and <i>Nodebuster</i>. Harvest resources, explore unique islands, and upgrade your skill tree.<br>Collect all the resources from each island to finally destroy the corruption that plagues it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The corruption runs deeper with every new island. Will you be able to cleanse them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 3 to 4 hours of relaxing harvesting and satisfying upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/d4e663a27d47fb70967a6aa646cb510b.avif?t=1771772468\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/7d8c685672b6c3315ae264a1439e3514.poster.avif?t=1771772468\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/7d8c685672b6c3315ae264a1439e3514.webm?t=1771772468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/7d8c685672b6c3315ae264a1439e3514.mp4?t=1771772468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The islands are rich in resources, be prepared to harvest them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start from wood and stone up to more precious resources, use them to upgrade the skill tree or learn new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/cc669c3c4bea4f56ae08c7ad779bec31.avif?t=1771772468\" width=600 height=90 /></span><